<title>USA: M.A.I.D says Nash resigns from board.</title>
<headline>M.A.I.D says Nash resigns from board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.A.I.D Plc said on Tuesday that Bill Nash resigned as a member of the company's board of directors. He continues to serve as a consultant to the company in the United States.</p>
<p>Nash would also relinquish his responsibilities as director of product development. The company relocated its U.S. development unit to London.</p>
<p>M.A.I.D. supplies business intelligence services to business professionals worldwide.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
